    "body": "Review fix pushed. Merged current main (which now has #500), then regenerated `golden/nc/tormach/probe_guard_moves.nc`: the only diff is the removed `S0 M3` line, the line this PR exists to remove. Re-run on the merged tree: `probe_guard` 5/5, `probe_spindle` 2/2, `probe_op` 11/11, `inverted_probe` 8/8, `conformance` 6/6, `tormach_post` 10/10, `posting` 17/17. The body's \"#500 should merge after this\" no longer applies, since #500 is on main and this PR now carries its golden. Re the non-blocking note: a hand-fed legacy stream with rpm 0 posts no spindle start, the same as fanuc.cps has since #108; every tool path through the app refuses rpm 0 (`Tool::is_sane`). Stays a draft until flagged ready again.",
